==Description==
'''v1.66.0''' is the one hundred and seventeenth update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 4th of June 2025. It introduced the {{Color|EventMission|Discovered}} [[Farm]] skin.

It has three versions, the main '''v1.66.0''' update (released 4 June 2025) and two minor updates, v1.66.1 (released 4 June 2025) and v1.66.1a (released 11 June 2025).

==Additions==
*{{Color|EventMission|Discovered}} [[Farm]]
*[[Walmart Discovered Pass]]

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*Added Wren to the lobby.
*Fixed [[Rocketeer]] having damage drop-off.

:In '''v1.66.1''':
*Fixed {{Color|EventMission|Discovered}} [[Farm]] being impossible to claim from the [[Gift Box]].
*Fixed maps not working.

:In '''v1.66.1a''':
*All [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]] rewards are no longer obtainable.

